{"3597260": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FAR FRESNEL", "steam_appid": 3597260, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FAR FRESNEL</strong> – What lies beneath?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597260/extras/67eaa783012224c200d6dc2a3f524ce0.avif?t=1775780805\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597260/extras_big/67eaa783012224c200d6dc2a3f524ce0.avif?t=1775780805 width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FAR FRESNEL</strong> is first-person exploration game where you descend into the abyss of a distant planet aboard an ancient elevator system. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you venture deeper into this forsaken world, you'll learn to control your environment, solve puzzles, and uncover the meaning behind CHIONE expeditions. With each level, the danger increases, and your only hope is to keep descending. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you survive long enough to reveal the secrets buried deep below the surface?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597260/extras/eb5947500543d483a1cfd5651ae00eed.avif?t=1775780805\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597260/extras_big/eb5947500543d483a1cfd5651ae00eed.avif?t=1775780805 width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FAR FRESNEL</strong> is a test of your mind, your sanity, your very will to survive in a hostile and forgotten world. Master the tools left by the previous mecano-printers to control and fix the elevator. Find pieces of the stories scattered across the environment using the Remote Explorer™ by NãoVivo Corp. and put light onto CHIONE's Team disappearance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597260/extras/dc0e6dbfaa2c199cfa17bbd8c0e2b682.avif?t=1775780805\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597260/extras_big/dc0e6dbfaa2c199cfa17bbd8c0e2b682.avif?t=1775780805 width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Maybe this expedition is pointless.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or maybe it will lead a nomad like you to answers you waited all your life.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FAR FRESNEL</strong> – What lies beneath?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597260/extras/67eaa783012224c200d6dc2a3f524ce0.avif?t=1775780805\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597260/extras_big/67eaa783012224c200d6dc2a3f524ce0.avif?t=1775780805 width=1560 height=520 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FAR FRESNEL</strong> is first-person exploration game where you descend into the abyss of a distant planet aboard an ancient elevator system. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you venture deeper into this forsaken world, you'll learn to control your environment, solve puzzles, and uncover the meaning behind CHIONE expeditions. With each level, the danger increases, and your only hope is to keep descending. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you survive long enough to reveal the secrets buried deep below the surface?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597260/extras/eb5947500543d483a1cfd5651ae00eed.avif?t=1775780805\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3597260/extras_big/eb594750054